     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello!<div><br></div><div>First of all, thanks to all people contributing to this awesome package and related packages. I&#39;m learning to be able to contribute, hopefully soon, but if there is something to tackle that needs more time and patience than knowledge, I&#39;m happy to give it (me) a chance.</div><div><br></div><div>That said, I&#39;m trying to get the hierarchical McDonald&#39;s omega reliability coefficients for a bifactor structure with effects-coding, and ordered observed variables. I&#39;m using cfa() with ULSMV(S) estimator and unless i set the observed variables to be numeric, realiability() function is giving me what looks like McDonald&#39;s omegaTotal (instead of omegaHierarchical) coefficients, and reliabilityL2() says <span style=\"color:rgb(181,137,0);font-family:&#39;Ubuntu Mono&#39;;font-size:10.4pt;line-height:16px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(253,246,227)\">Error in be[[1]] : subscript out of bounds</span>. Is possible to get omegaH with ordered outcomes? How? Thanks in advance!</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>What I get with observed variables set as ordered (as it should) or numeric (not desirable for a Likert type scale); the later seems more to what I expect while keeping variables as ordinal (smaller specific factor omegaH):</div><div><table style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-collapse:collapse;width:910px;max-width:100%;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px\"><caption style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-top:8px;padding-bottom:8px;color:rgb(119,119,119);text-align:left\">Reliability of factors</caption><thead style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><tr style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><th style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:5px;line-height:1.42857;vertical-align:bottom;border-bottom-width:2px;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-color:rgb(221,221,221)\"></th><th align=\"right\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:5px;line-height:1.42857;vertical-align:bottom;border-bottom-width:2px;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-color:rgb(221,221,221)\">EVFB</th><th align=\"right\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:5px;line-height:1.42857;vertical-align:bottom;border-bottom-width:2px;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-color:rgb(221,221,221)\">PBT</th><th align=\"right\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:5px;line-height:1.42857;vertical-align:bottom;border-bottom-width:2px;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-color:rgb(221,221,221)\">LC</th><th align=\"right\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:5px;line-height:1.42857;vertical-align:bottom;border-bottom-width:2px;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-color:rgb(221,221,221)\">PURSL</th><th align=\"right\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:5px;line-height:1.42857;vertical-align:bottom;border-bottom-width:2px;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-color:rgb(221,221,221)\">CG</th><th align=\"right\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:5px;line-height:1.42857;vertical-align:bottom;border-bottom-width:2px;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-color:rgb(221,221,221)\">CS</th><th align=\"right\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:5px;line-height:1.42857;vertical-align:bottom;border-bottom-width:2px;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-color:rgb(221,221,221)\">g</th><th align=\"right\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:5px;line-height:1.42857;vertical-align:bottom;border-bottom-width:2px;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-color:rgb(221,221,221)\">total</th></tr></thead><tbody style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><tr style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><td style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:5px;line-height:1.42857;vertical-align:top;border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:rgb(221,221,221)\"><br></td><td align=\"right\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:5px;line-height:1.42857;vertical-align:top;border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:rgb(221,221,221)\"><br></td><td align=\"right\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:5px;line-height:1.42857;vertical-align:top;border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:rgb(221,221,221)\"><br></td><td align=\"right\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:5px;line-height:1.42857;vertical-align:top;border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:rgb(221,221,221)\"><br></td><td align=\"right\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:5px;line-height:1.42857;vertical-align:top;border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:rgb(221,221,221)\"><br></td><td align=\"right\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:5px;line-height:1.42857;vertical-align:top;border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:rgb(221,221,221)\"><br></td><td align=\"right\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:5px;line-height:1.42857;vertical-align:top;border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:rgb(221,221,221)\"><br></td><td align=\"right\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:5px;line-height:1.42857;vertical-align:top;border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:rgb(221,221,221)\"><br></td><td align=\"right\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:5px;line-height:1.42857;vertical-align:top;border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:rgb(221,221,221)\"><br></td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><td style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:5px;line-height:1.42857;vertical-align:top;border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:rgb(221,221,221)\">McD omegaT (as ordered)</td><td align=\"right\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:5px;line-height:1.42857;vertical-align:top;border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:rgb(221,221,221)\">0.88</td><td align=\"right\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:5px;line-height:1.42857;vertical-align:top;border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:rgb(221,221,221)\">0.85</td><td align=\"right\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:5px;line-height:1.42857;vertical-align:top;border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:rgb(221,221,221)\">0.93</td><td align=\"right\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:5px;line-height:1.42857;vertical-align:top;border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:rgb(221,221,221)\">0.88</td><td align=\"right\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:5px;line-height:1.42857;vertical-align:top;border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:rgb(221,221,221)\">0.88</td><td align=\"right\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:5px;line-height:1.42857;vertical-align:top;border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:rgb(221,221,221)\">0.75</td><td align=\"right\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:5px;line-height:1.42857;vertical-align:top;border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:rgb(221,221,221)\">0.97</td><td align=\"right\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:5px;line-height:1.42857;vertical-align:top;border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:rgb(221,221,221)\">0.97</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><td style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:5px;line-height:1.42857;vertical-align:top;border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:rgb(221,221,221)\">McD omegaH (as numeric)</td><td align=\"right\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:5px;line-height:1.42857;vertical-align:top;border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:rgb(221,221,221)\">0.22</td><td align=\"right\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:5px;line-height:1.42857;vertical-align:top;border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:rgb(221,221,221)\">0.32</td><td align=\"right\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:5px;line-height:1.42857;vertical-align:top;border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:rgb(221,221,221)\">0.30</td><td align=\"right\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:5px;line-height:1.42857;vertical-align:top;border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:rgb(221,221,221)\">0.08</td><td align=\"right\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:5px;line-height:1.42857;vertical-align:top;border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:rgb(221,221,221)\">0.19</td><td align=\"right\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:5px;line-height:1.42857;vertical-align:top;border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:rgb(221,221,221)\">0.34</td><td align=\"right\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:5px;line-height:1.42857;vertical-align:top;border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:rgb(221,221,221)\">0.91</td><td align=\"right\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:5px;line-height:1.42857;vertical-align:top;border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:rgb(221,221,221)\">0.97<br><br></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>The model:</div><div><br></div><div><div>&#39; </div><div>EVFB =~ NA * x9 + a1*x9 + b1*x11 + c1*x12 + d1*x23 + e1*x25</div><div>PBT =~  NA * x1 + a2*x1 + b2*x2 + c2*x3 + d2*x4 + e2*x5</div><div>LC =~   NA * x10 + a3*x10 + b3*x24 + c3*x26 + d3*x27 + e3*x28 + f3*x29</div><div>PURSL =~ NA * x13 + a4*x13 + b4*x14 + c4*x15 + d4*x16 + e4*x17 + f4*x18 + g4*x19</div><div>CG =~    NA * x6 + a5*x6 + b5*x7 + c5*x8</div><div>CS =~   NA * x20 + a6*x20 + b6*x21 + c6*x22</div><div>g =~    NA * x1 + a7*x1 + b7*x2 + c7*x3 + d7*x4 + e7*x5 + f7*x6 + g7*x7 + h7*x8 </div><div>+ i7*x9 + j7*x10 + k7*x11 + l7*x12 + m7*x13 + n7*x14 + o7*x15 + p7*x16 + q7*x17 </div><div>+ r7*x18 + s7*x19 + t7*x20 + u7*x21 + v7*x22 + w7*x23 + x7*x24 + y7*x25 </div><div>+ z7*x26 + aa7*x27 + ab7*x28 + ac7*x29</div><div><br></div><div>a1 + b1 + c1 + d1 + e1 == 5</div><div>a2 + b2 + c2 + d2 + e2 == 5</div><div>a3 + b3 + c3 + d3 + e3 + f3 == 6</div><div>a4 + b4 + c4 + d4 + e4 + f4 + g4 == 7</div><div>a5 + b5 + c5 == 3</div><div>a6 + b6 + c6 == 3</div><div>a7 + b7 + c7 + d7 + e7 + f7 + g7 + h7 + i7 + j7 + k7 + l7 + m7 + n7 + o7 + p7 + q7 + r7 + s7 + t7 + u7 + v7 + w7 + x7 + y7 + z7 + aa7 + ab7 + ac7 == 29</div><div><br></div><div>g ~~ 0*EVFB             </div><div>g ~~ 0*PBT              </div><div>g ~~ 0*LC               </div><div>g ~~ 0*PURSL</div><div>g ~~ 0*CG</div><div>g ~~ 0*CS</div><div>EVFB ~~ 0*PBT</div><div>EVFB ~~ 0*LC</div><div>EVFB ~~ 0*PURSL</div><div>EVFB ~~ 0*CG</div><div>EVFB ~~ 0*CS</div><div>PBT ~~ 0*LC</div><div>PBT ~~ 0*PURSL</div><div>PBT ~~ 0*CG</div><div>PBT ~~ 0*CS</div><div>LC ~~ 0*PURSL</div><div>LC ~~ 0*CG</div><div>LC ~~ 0*CS</div><div>PURSL ~~ 0*CG</div><div>PURSL ~~ 0*CS</div><div>CG ~~ 0*CS</div><div>&#39;</div></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div>"
